{{PIE root|ang|bʰer}}
From {{inh|ang|gem-pro|*beraną}}, from {{der|ang|ine-pro|*bʰer-}}.
Cognate with {{cog|osx|beran}}, {{cog|goh|beran}}, {{cog|non|bera}}, {{cog|got|𐌱𐌰𐌹𐍂𐌰𐌽}}. The Indo-European root was also the source of {{cog|sga|biru}}, {{cog|grc|φέρω}}, {{cog|la|ferre}}.

===Pronunciation===
